#: ../../source/docs/simple-mode.rst:5 ../../source/docs/simple-mode.rst:37
#: 7c3efe33a541445aba5dfdd378938066 e5d4fa02218f4691946c6d3aa5eaac71
msgid "Simple Mode"
msgstr "Simple 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/simple-mode.rst:7 42afc53ab99044ca94a7bb060aa735fb
msgid ""
"Simple mode allows the pilot to control the movement of the vehicle from the"
" pilot's point of view regardless of which way the vehicle is currently "
"facing. This is useful for new pilots who have not mastered adjusting their "
"steering inputs depending upon which way the vehicle is facing and for cases"
" when the vehicle is far enough away that its heading is not apparent."
msgstr ""
"Simple "
"模式允许飞手从自身视角控制车辆的运动方向，无论车辆当前朝向如何。这对尚未掌握根据车辆朝向调整转向输入技巧的新手飞手非常有用，也适用于车辆距离较远以至于难以判断其朝向的情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/simple-mode.rst:13 d13089a090d84200a444f69d776a7304
msgid ""
"Simple Mode allows you to control the vehicle relative to the vehicle's "
"heading at arming and relies only on a good compass heading."
msgstr "Simple 模式允许您相对于车辆解锁时的朝向来控制车辆，仅依赖良好的罗盘航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/simple-mode.rst:18 2d9984ab98464a04b68181c0dcfb93f5
msgid "Manual/Acro Mode"
msgstr "Manual/Acro 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/simple-mode.rst:23 84116783983e474b85ee5bc7ed0f538c
msgid ""
"In Manual or Acro modes, the pilot's transmitter stick inputs are applied in"
" the orientation of the vehicle.  For example, in the diagram above when the"
" pilot applies yaw right (red) the vehicle yaws to its right as long as the "
"stick input is not released."
msgstr ""
"在 Manual 或 Acro "
"模式下，飞手的发射机摇杆输入以车辆自身朝向为参考系执行。例如，在上图中，当飞手向右打偏航（红色），车辆将向其右侧偏航，直至摇杆输入释放。"

#: ../../source/docs/simple-mode.rst:28 abad77d0bfde44359ef0de3f0c9a6e91
msgid ""
"With the vehicle is facing in the same direction as the pilot, it is "
"relatively easy to control the vehicle but when the vehicle is facing "
"towards the pilot an inexperienced pilot will feel that the controls are all"
" reversed.  I.e. if the pilot inputs right yaw, the vehicle will steer to "
"the left from the pilot's point of view."
msgstr ""
"当车辆与飞手朝向相同时，控制较为容易；但当车辆朝向飞手时，缺乏经验的飞手会感觉控制方向完全颠倒。即：飞手向右打偏航时，从飞手视角看，车辆会向左转向。"

#: ../../source/docs/simple-mode.rst:42 f45da381f99845848ac85688e9993298
msgid ""
"This mode allows you to pilot your vehicle as though it were pointed in the "
"direction it was pointed when it was armed regardless of its current heading"
" orientation.  So if you hold the throttle stick forward the vehicle will "
"move away from you (in the direction it was armed), pull the throttle stick "
"back and it will turn around and come back towards you, in the opposite "
"direction from when it was armed. Likewise, if you hold the  steering stick "
"to the right with the throttle at neutral, the vehicle will turn to face a "
"direction 90 degrees to that when armed and move in that direction."
msgstr ""
"此模式允许您以车辆解锁时的朝向为参考来驾驶，无论当前实际朝向如何。向前推油门摇杆，车辆将远离您（朝解锁时的方向）；向后拉油门摇杆，车辆将掉头向您驶来，即与解锁时相反的方向。同样，在油门处于中立时将转向摇杆向右打，车辆将转向面朝解锁时方向右侧90度的方向并向该方向行驶。"

#: ../../source/docs/simple-mode.rst:47 5ef150aaee414c15a404d1c24b62a0d2
msgid ""
"The speed at which the vehicle moves is directly proportional the throttle "
"and/or steering stick's position away from neutral and is similar to Acro "
"mode, where neutral is stopped, and full stick is maximum speed "
"(:ref:`SPEED_MAX<SPEED_MAX>`). With full forward stick on throttle, the "
"vehicle will attempt to go maximum speed in the arming direction, at 75%, "
"the speed target will be 1/2 of maximum, at 25% 1/2 maximum in the opposite "
"direction as it was armed. Likewise for the steering stick, full right is "
"maximum speed at 90 degrees, full left is maximum at -90 degrees from arming"
" direction. The speed target is limited to the maximum speed, so full "
"forward throttle and full right steering does not result in faster than "
"maximum speed at 45 degrees, but instead is limited to maximum."
msgstr ""
"车辆的速度与油门和/或转向摇杆偏离中立的量成正比，类似于 Acro "
"模式：中立为停止，满杆为最大速度（:ref:`SPEED_MAX<SPEED_MAX>`）。油门全前推时，车辆将尝试以最大速度朝解锁方向行驶；75% "
"时速度目标为最大值的1/2；25% "
"时为反方向最大值的1/2。转向摇杆同理：全右为以最大速度朝右侧90度方向行驶，全左为朝左侧-90度方向最大速度行驶。速度目标受最大速度限制，因此全前油门加全右转向不会产生45度方向超过最大速度的行驶，而是限制在最大速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/simple-mode.rst:49 8793a6206d5a4ac0bb18e84f220484aa
msgid ""
"Generally when arming you should stand behind the vehicle with its nose "
"pointing directly away from you when arming.  While moving you should try to"
" keep the vehicle  in front of its starting position because if it moves "
"behind you all the controls will feel reversed."
msgstr ""
"通常解锁时应站在车辆正后方，车头直接朝向远离您的方向。行驶过程中应尽量保持车辆在起始位置前方，因为一旦车辆移动到您身后，所有控制方向都会感觉颠倒。"

#: ../../source/docs/simple-mode.rst:54 00b736220d05414c8829037b7923ebcb
msgid ""
"As mentioned above simple mode is also very useful in emergency situations "
"where the vehicle is far enough away that it is very difficult to determine "
"its heading."
msgstr "如上所述，Simple 模式在紧急情况下也非常有用，例如车辆距离过远、难以判断其朝向时。"

#: ../../source/docs/simple-mode.rst:58 bf47e906f42f4205a4322bf6560c23c3
msgid ""
"The :ref:`SIMPLE_TYPE<SIMPLE_TYPE>` parameter allows the  movement direction"
" to be based on absolute North/South/East/West compass directions instead of"
" relative to arming direction."
msgstr ":ref:`SIMPLE_TYPE<SIMPLE_TYPE>` 参数允许将运动方向改为基于绝对的东南西北方向，而非相对于解锁时的方向。"
